<title>POLAND: POLISH PROCUREMENT PRICES RISE IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>POLISH PROCUREMENT PRICES RISE IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement grain, pork</p>
<p>cattle and milk prices rose in September, the Central</p>
<p>Statistical Office (GUS) said on Friday.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES	   SEPTEMBER  AUGUST    SEPT 95</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  57.34     56.42    34.58</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 1.6     -12.6	4.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			65.8	71.1     42.3</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  36.94     35.11    21.75</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 5.2     -11.4	0.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			69.8	62.6     25.0</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.66	2.59     2.56</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 2.5	 1.6	6.5</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			 3.6	 7.7     39.4</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.83	3.38     2.77</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		13.1	 8.9	3.8</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			38.0	26.6	2.1</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.51	0.50     0.45</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 1.8	 0.6	3.5</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			13.3	15.2     59.9</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
